<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in active trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average fell 71.31 points to 8,188.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite index lost 4.38 to 492.62.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down 41 cents.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 1,552 to 1,218.</p>
<p>Volume was 576,032,210 compared with 565,170,540 on Wednesday.</p>
